          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bhöyö bheene nkaaga ömögeni öno atarë umui wa abhantö bhaao Isiraeri naraache gukurua gönsë ya aharai gikugira yi iriina reeo irikumahe, na gikugira yi ichinguru chaao na ubhuriihi bhooo, gösabha kunyumba ëno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakögeya umuigua kurua waao kuriöbha köyö, na öha ömögeni öyö gaara gonsui aragösabhe, korri abhantö bhonsui gökëbhara bhatöre köngöra iriina reeo na gukuiguëra keebhörë abhantö bhaao Isiraeri bhaagökora na bhamanye iga inyumba ëno nahagaacha nëmanyëkaini kuriina reeo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
