              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abhantö bhaao hano bharaayi kuiihi guitana na abhabhisa bhaabho harë honsui urabhahire, nabho bhagösabhe bhasiorri umugi göno na inyumba ëno nahagaacha gikugira yi iriina reeo, ",
          "type": "text",
