        {
          "text": "bhoono, ndakögeya wigue ësaasaamo yaabho kuriöbha hayö örëngë na amasabhi gaabho na öbhaha bhino bhibhaitungërë, waabhëra abhantö bhaao bhano bhaakora amaraga kuguisiira.”",
